    "title": "The Cheap Part That Can Stop the Factory",
    "excerpt": "A careful look at how ordinary, certified semiconductor components can become strategic chokepoints—and what the verified Nexperia record does and does not establish.",
    "category": "Beacon Signal Watch Brief",
    "date": "October 20, 2026",
    "readTime": "9 min read",
    "pillar": "Systems",
    "pillarColor": "#3D4F6B",
